    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "HOT LEAD FOLLOW-UP WORKFLOW\n\nRuns every 15 minutes automatically.\n\nWHAT IT DOES:\n→ Reads your Bot Leads Google Sheet\n→ Finds leads older than 1 hour with Status = 'New'\n→ Sends a personalized follow-up message via Messenger\n   (references the customer's specific product interest)\n→ Updates their Status to 'Followed Up'\n→ Each lead only ever receives ONE follow-up\n\nBEFORE ACTIVATING — replace these 4 things:\n\n1. REPLACE_WITH_BOT_LEADS_SPREADSHEET_ID\n   → Open your Bot Leads Google Sheet\n   → Copy the ID from the URL between /d/ and /edit\n   → Paste into both Google Sheets nodes\n\n2. REPLACE_WITH_SHEET_TAB_NAME\n   → The name of the tab in your sheet (e.g. 'Bot Leads')\n   → Paste into both Google Sheets nodes\n\n3. REPLACE_WITH_SHEETS_CREDENTIAL_ID\n   → Your Google Sheets credential from n8n\n   → Applies to both Google Sheets nodes\n\n4. REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_PAGE_ACCESS_TOKEN\n   → Same token used in the main RAG chatbot\n   → Paste into the HTTP Request node\n\nFACEBOOK POLICY NOTE:\nFollow-up messages only work within the 24-hour\nmessaging window. Since leads trigger within minutes\nof the customer chatting, the 1-hour follow-up\nalways stays well within this limit.",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-280, -120],
